# Seamless Login via URL Payload

The goal is to provide a way to log a user in directly via a URL containing `UserName`, `Token`, and `timestamp`, bypassing the OTP verification step, while keeping changes localized to the existing [Home](file:///d:/dev/Ayurved/Ayurved_bkp12032026/AyurvedaPortal/Controllers/LoginController.cs#30-69) action method in [LoginController.cs](file:///d:/dev/Ayurved/Ayurved_bkp12032026/AyurvedaPortal/Controllers/LoginController.cs).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> To proceed, I still need a bit of clarification on the payload:
